                    <article class="mt-5">
                         <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                   <section class="col-md-8 co-lg-9 order-1 order-md-0">
                                   	<h2>Opelika, Valley, and Wadley Campus Tours</h2>

<p><meta content="text/html; charset=us-ascii" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
<style type="text/css">a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
}
tr th, tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
}
tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}
</style>
</p>

<p>Our office would be honored to host you for a tour of our campus. We offer tours at the Opelika, Valley, and Wadley&nbsp;campuses. Tours offer a unique opportunity to see the campus and learn more about Southern Union. Please select &quot; Schedule Campus Tour&quot; below to schedule a tour and reserve your tour date and time.</p>

<hr />
<h3>Schedule Your Tour&nbsp;</h3>

<p style="margin-bottom:16px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="box-sizing:border-box"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="widows:2"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span new="" roman="" style="font-family:" times=""><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span arial="" style="font-family:"><span style="color:#212121">Please schedule your Tour in advance.&nbsp;Find the date you would like to tour; click on the date&nbsp;if available, select the tour time and correct campus,&nbsp;and then complete the registration form.&nbsp; Once you have registered and submitted the request, you will receive an email confirmation with instructions about where to arrive to begin your tour.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:16px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px"><a href="https://suscc.my.salesforce-sites.com/events"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="box-sizing:border-box"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="widows:2"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span new="" roman="" style="font-family:" times=""><span class="btn btn-blue" style="font-size:10.5pt">Schedule Campus Tour</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:16px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="box-sizing:border-box"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="widows:2"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span new="" roman="" style="font-family:" times=""><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span arial="" style="font-family:"><span style="color:#212121">This walking tour is led by a student ambassador. The tour lasts around one hour. Please note that tours are dependent on weather, so check the forecast before you head to campus.&nbsp; We will not be able to conduct the tour in inclement weather. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span new="" roman="" style="font-family:" times=""><span style="font-size:10.5pt"><span arial="" style="font-family:"><span style="color:#212121">If you need to cancel for any reason, please email <a href="mailto:recruiting@suscc.edu" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">recruiting@suscc.edu</a> and let us know that you will not be able to make your tour.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<hr />
<h3 data-pm-slice="1 1 []">Schedule a Group Tour</h3>

<p>Southern Union State Community College welcomes schools, organizations, and other groups to explore our campuses! Group tours offer students an opportunity to experience campus life, learn about our programs, and discover what Southern Union has to offer.</p>

<p><strong>Group Tour Scheduling Guidelines:</strong></p>

<ul data-spread="false">
	<li>
	<p>Requests must be submitted at least <strong>14 days in advance</strong>.</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Tours are available Monday&ndash;Thursday, 10:00 a.m.&ndash;2:00 p.m., and Friday, 8:00&ndash;11:00 a.m.</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Weekend tours are not available.</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Please provide three preferred dates and times when submitting your request.</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>All group tours are subject to staff availability and approval by the Recruiting Office.</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Please note:</strong> Submitting a Group Tour Request Form does not guarantee a reservation. A member of our Recruiting Office will contact you to confirm scheduling details.</p>

<p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="https://suscc.jotform.com/262926079253969"><strong>Request a Group Tour</strong></a></p>

<hr />
<p style="margin-bottom:16px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin-bottom:16px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px"><sup><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:28.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%">Open Houses at SU</span></span></span></span></span></span></sup><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:28.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><b data-ogsc="" data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">We are excited to invite you to explore life as a Bison!</b>&nbsp;Whether you are taking your first step toward a degree or returning to finish what you started, our Open House events are designed to give you a genuine look at life at Southern Union&mdash;on your terms and at your pace.</p>

<p>Our&nbsp;<b data-ogsc="">Wadley and Opelika campuses&nbsp;</b>will host Open House events on select dates throughout the year from 4:30&ndash;7:00 p.m. CST.&nbsp;</p>

<p>These events are&nbsp;<b data-ogsc="">casual, drop-in opportunities, allowing you to visit when it is most convenient for you</b>. To help us prepare for your visit and better understand how we can meet your needs, we encourage you to pre-register using the links below next to each event. Groups are welcome to attend!</p>

<p>During Open House, you will have the opportunity to explore more than just a traditional campus tour. Learn about&nbsp;<b data-ogsc="">student services, academic programs, health sciences, technical programs, and campus life</b>, while getting a firsthand look at the opportunities and resources available to you as a Southern Union student.</p>

<p>Whether you are just beginning to explore your options, ready to apply, or returning to complete your education, Southern Union is here to meet you where you are and help you take your next step forward into The Herd!</p>

<p><strong>Opelika Open House Dates:</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">
	<p>Oct. 6th:&nbsp; Meet us at the Opelika National Night Out on the Courtyard Square&nbsp;</p>
	</li>
	<li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">
	<p><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsuscc.my.salesforce-sites.com%2Fevents%23%2Fesr%3Feid%3Da1EWP0000152Cg62AE&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cjwatson%40suscc.edu%7C21603abe29434b7459bb08df14c4a93c%7C1d45f02c5d784376b608cec51ef0e96e%7C0%7C0%7C639252507090092371%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ncu%2BVu90%2F%2F98Rwc3Tz2tdzAR6b0IZhb3wx%2BLcwH%2Bim4%3D&amp;reserved=0">Nov. 5<sup data-ogsc="">th</sup>&nbsp;</a></p>
	</li>
	<li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsuscc.my.salesforce-sites.com%2Fevents%23%2Fesr%3Feid%3Da1EWP000015apyU2AQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cjwatson%40suscc.edu%7C21603abe29434b7459bb08df14c4a93c%7C1d45f02c5d784376b608cec51ef0e96e%7C0%7C0%7C639252507090117273%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=i0BqBaLY3V2gp6Ep7EfRYUFDdjy9jJqu4E77hxJM%2F38%3D&amp;reserved=0">Dec. 1st&nbsp;(Virtual)</a></li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Wadley open House Dates:</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">
	<p><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsuscc.my.salesforce-sites.com%2Fevents%23%2Fesr%3Feid%3Da1EWP000015apyU2AQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cjwatson%40suscc.edu%7C21603abe29434b7459bb08df14c4a93c%7C1d45f02c5d784376b608cec51ef0e96e%7C0%7C0%7C639252507090117273%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=i0BqBaLY3V2gp6Ep7EfRYUFDdjy9jJqu4E77hxJM%2F38%3D&amp;reserved=0">Oct. 13th</a></p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<hr />
<h2 style="margin-bottom: 11px;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><strong><span style="font-size:28.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span calibri="" style="font-family:">Preview Days at SU</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></h2>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><strong><span style="font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif"></span></strong></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 11px;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><strong><span calibri="" style="font-family:"><span style="font-weight:normal">Join us this Fall on the Opelika and Wadley campuses for one of our Preview Days!</span></span></strong> Students will experience an immersive look into campus life, academic programs, and the many opportunities available at Southern Union. Meet our amazing faculty and staff, explore your next steps, and discover how to strengthen your <strong><span calibri="" style="font-family:"><span style="font-weight:normal">herd power</span></span></strong> as you plan for your future. Registration links coming soon!<span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<h4 style="margin-bottom: 11px;"><u><a href="https://suscc.my.salesforce-sites.com/events#/esr?eid=a1EWP00000zY7s82AC"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">Opelika Campus Preview Day</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a></u></h4>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">Date: November 3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">Check</span></span></span><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span cambria="" math="">‑</span></span></span><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">In: 8:15</span></span></span><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">&ndash;</span></span></span><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">9:00 a.m. CDT</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">Event Time: 9:00 a.m.&ndash;12:00 p.m.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span arial="" black="">Location: The Southern Room</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

